  "story": {
    "day": 127,
    "title": "Kaya's London Trip",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya would often dream; her family finally took her far away to London.",
      "They left their hotel early on the fourth day for a public tour.",
      "They went straight around a museum to look for exhibits.",
      "Kaya saw wild wolves and a fierce wolf in paintings.",
      "A volunteer told them about a royal court and old battles.",
      "Later, they ate a delicious roast dinner out.",
      "They enjoyed a musical, seeing a famous actor.",
      "Past the twelfth hour, Kaya felt tired and wanted to lie down.",
      "She was careful to hold her souvenir, not to lose or drop it.",
      "\"Which way?\" her father asked. Kaya knew the answer and carried their bags.",
      "They needed a break, then moved fast to the airport.",
      "They would leave London on the fourteenth."
    ]
  }
